# What a riscv64 cell adds after the era's fragment (spec 06.2). The virt machine's UART is a 8250 found through the device tree, which needs the OF glue on top of the fragment's 8250 driver. SOC_VIRT is the switch kernels before 5.17 have for the machine.
CONFIG_SOC_VIRT=y
CONFIG_SERIAL_OF_PLATFORM=y
